    "updated_at": "2020-03-06T16:35:06Z",
    "body": "Not even in a non-normative note?  Maybe just saying that browsers can choose to allow extensions to add headers that bypass this check?\r\n\r\nThe reality currently is that browsers do make this exemption for both extensions and browser added headers, but there is no indication in the spec at all.",
