    "body": "+1 for adding a note at least. I think it could avoid significant confusion, both on the implementation side (it's not clear currently from the spec that browsers are allowed to add additional CORS preflight-bypassing headers) and from the server operator side (it's not clear currently that your server could get hit by non-CORS-safelisted headers set by the browser).",
